{"workId":"heidelberg-catechism","book":"HAB","excerpts":[{"id":"heidelberg-catechism:3efa0f74","workId":"heidelberg-catechism","text":"But may images not be tolerated in the churches as \"books for the laity\"?\nNo, for we should not be wiser than God. He wants His people to be taught not by means of dumb images but by the living preaching of His Word.","locator":"Q. 98","url":"https://github.com/NonlinearFruit/Creeds.json/blob/2ae21a4c5387ecc91f474c9d3d67c826d2a6b9d5/creeds/heidelberg_catechism.json","verseRanges":[{"start":{"book":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":18},"end":{"book":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":20}}],"mappingMethod":"proofText","type":"catechism","era":"medievalReformation","charOffset":0,"verbatimHash":"36bd7f74764e8450dcf35c690b1569a9a79ba977303e9a306ab8a491cc5a6612","rawIndex":0,"sourcePaths":["Data.97.Question","Data.97.Answer"],"partOffsets":[0,0]},{"id":"heidelberg-catechism:eb07c869","workId":"heidelberg-catechism","text":"But what does it help you now that you believe all this?\nIn Christ I am righteous before God and heir to life everlasting.","locator":"Q. 59","url":"https://github.com/NonlinearFruit/Creeds.json/blob/2ae21a4c5387ecc91f474c9d3d67c826d2a6b9d5/creeds/heidelberg_catechism.json","verseRanges":[{"start":{"book":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":4},"end":{"book":"HAB","chapter":2,"verse":4}}],"mappingMethod":"proofText","type":"catechism","era":"medievalReformation","charOffset":0,"verbatimHash":"0321f8f13e4669ae266a075eadea410f28edd21e42cd519dbf84e98db6ede222","rawIndex":0,"sourcePaths":["Data.58.Question","Data.58.Answer"],"partOffsets":[0,0]}]}